To simplify the notation for our construction, we introduce the following arrow notation.
For $(x,y) \in V$ we define $(x,y) \rightarrow (x+ \ell,y) \coloneqq \{\{(x+i,y),(x+i+1,y)\} \in E \mid 0 \leq i < \ell\}$.
Analogously we define $\uparrow, \downarrow$ and $\leftarrow$.
%
We also use the concatenation of these expressions such that e.g.~$u \rightarrow v \uparrow w \coloneqq (u \rightarrow v) \cup (v \uparrow w)$. %

